        "body": "Stonex Financial obligated $1.1B in FY21, $1.7B in FY22, $1.7B in FY23, $703M in FY24, $1.3B in FY25, and $1.3B in FY26. Obligations fell 2.9% year over year in the current reporting period. The FY24 drop to $703M preceded a recovery to $1.3B in FY25 and FY26."
